      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7547175450821320253, guid: 2106bc57bb0f2494489d3956a7e3b8c1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: content
      value: "[Temp] \nRules of alchemy laboratory:\n1. Every visitior below master
        level of clearence requires personal permission from any master.\n2. Only
        brewed potions can be taken outside of the laboratory, all ingrediens (no
        matter if found there or brewed personaly) must remain there.\n3. Experiments
        are conducted on sole responsibility of the experimentor.\n4. Once the experiments
        are completed, the cauldron must be resealed and all remaining ingredients
        shall be stowed away."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
